      "zh": {
        "title": "國防部偵獲7艘共艦6艘公務船台海周邊活動未發現共機",
        "summary": "國防部表示台海周邊偵獲中共7艘軍艦與6艘公務船；未發現共機",
        "body": [
          "國防部於2026年8月21日上午發布中共解放軍台海周邊海域與空域動態。根據官方發布資料，自8月20日上午6時至8月21日上午6時止，國軍共偵獲中共軍艦7艘及公務船6艘，持續在台灣海峽周邊海域進行活動。",
          "國防部表示，國軍部隊在該24小時監測期間內，運用任務機、任務艦以及岸置飛彈系統，對台海周邊動態實施嚴密監控與應處。",
          "國防部補充說明，自8月20日上午6時至8月21日上午6時的統計期間內，未偵獲任何中共軍機進入周邊空域，因此本次動態通報未提供航跡圖。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Taiwan MND Tracks 7 PLA Warships and 6 Official Vessels; No Aircraft Detected",
        "summary": "Taiwan's defence ministry detected seven PLA warships and six official vessels around Taiwan with no aircraft reported.",
        "body": [
          "Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense released its operational update on August 21, 2026, detailing People's Liberation Army activity around the Taiwan Strait. Between 06:00 on August 20 and 06:00 on August 21, military authorities detected seven PLA warships and six official vessels operating in the waters surrounding Taiwan.",
          "In response to the naval activity, Taiwanese armed forces deployed mission aircraft, naval vessels, and shore-based missile systems to closely monitor and respond to the movements.",
          "The ministry added that no PLA aircraft were detected in the airspace around Taiwan during the same 24-hour monitoring period. Consequently, no flight track map was provided in the daily release."
        ]
      },
